{"answer":"For a $30,000 initial deposit, refer your partner to the Navy Blue Business Checking account. You would receive a $100 referral bonus if the business deposits at least $5,000 within 90 days. You must have been a Rho-Bank checking customer for at least 60 days.

The higher-paying business referrals require larger deposits: True Blue pays you $350 but requires $50,000 within 120 days, while Beige pays you $500 but requires $100,000 within 120 days. Therefore, based on the stated $30,000 funding amount, Navy Blue is the highest bonus he can currently qualify for.

Additional conditions include that he must be a new Rho-Bank customer, the business must have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account, the deposit must be new money, and only one referral promotion can be used. Referral bonuses are also limited to two in any rolling nine-day period."}
